#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:7
msgid "There are several ways to customize your Mattermost server."
msgstr "Mattermost 서버를 사용자 지정하는 방법은 여러 가지가 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:9
msgid ""
"If customizing Mattermost, please avoid branding that could be confused "
"with the Mattermost brand. For example, it's okay to brand as "
"\"Healthcare Central\" because it's a completely different brand. "
"\"Mattermost Healthcare Central\" is not okay, because it can potentially"
" be confused with the Mattermost brand. Please see the `Mattermost "
"trademark guidelines <https://mattermost.com/trademark-standards-of-"
"use/>`_ for details."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost를 사용자 지정하는 경우, Mattermost 브랜드와 혼동될 수 있는 브랜딩은 "
"피하세요. 예를 들어 \"Healthcare Central\"은 완전히 다른 브랜드이므로 괜찮습니다. "
"\"Mattermost Healthcare Central\"은 Mattermost 브랜드와 혼동될 수 있으므로 "
"안 됩니다. 자세한 내용은 `Mattermost 상표 지침 "
"<https://mattermost.com/trademark-standards-of-use/>`_\\ 을 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:11
msgid ""
"While you're welcome to add your own copyright notice in the user "
"interface if you feel it is warranted by your changes, we ask that you do"
" not remove the Mattermost, Inc. copyright notice from the login footer "
"or from the About dialog."
msgstr ""
"변경 사항에 따라 필요하다고 판단되면 사용자 인터페이스에 자체 저작권 고지를 추가해도 "
"좋지만, 로그인 푸터나 정보(About) 대화 상자에서 Mattermost, Inc. 저작권 고지는 "
"제거하지 말아 주세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:14
msgid "Mattermost Web App"
msgstr "Mattermost 웹 앱"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:16
msgid ""
"The Mattermost webapp is licensed under the Apache 2.0 license. To modify"
" and use with the Mattermost server, you can:"
msgstr ""
"Mattermost 웹앱은 Apache 2.0 라이선스에 따라 라이선스가 부여됩니다. 이를 수정하여 "
"Mattermost 서버와 함께 사용하려면 다음과 같이 할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:18
msgid "Install the Mattermost server by following one of our installation guides"
msgstr "설치 가이드 중 하나를 따라 Mattermost 서버를 설치합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:19
msgid ""
"Fork the `mattermost <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost>`_ "
"repository"
msgstr ""
"`mattermost <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost>`_ 저장소를 포크합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:20
msgid ""
"Go to the web app code located in the ``webapp`` directory and make your "
"changes"
msgstr ""
"``webapp`` 디렉토리에 있는 웹 앱 코드로 이동하여 변경 사항을 적용합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:21
msgid "Run ``make package`` to create ``mattermost-webapp.tar.gz``"
msgstr "``make package``\\ 를 실행하여 ``mattermost-webapp.tar.gz``\\ 를 생성합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:22
msgid ""
"Copy ``mattermost-webapp-tar.gz`` to the location Mattermost was "
"installed in Step 1"
msgstr ""
"1단계에서 Mattermost가 설치된 위치로 ``mattermost-webapp-tar.gz``\\ 를 "
"복사합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:23
msgid "Rename the existing ``client`` folder to ``client-original``"
msgstr "기존 ``client`` 폴더의 이름을 ``client-original``\\ 로 변경합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:24
msgid ""
"Run ``tar -xvf mattermost-webapp.tar.gz`` to extract your new customized "
"``client`` folder"
msgstr ""
"``tar -xvf mattermost-webapp.tar.gz``\\ 를 실행하여 새로 사용자 지정한 "
"``client`` 폴더를 추출합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:25
msgid ""
"If you're installing Mattermost 7.5 - 7.10, copy the ``products`` folder "
"from ``client-original`` into ``client``"
msgstr ""
"Mattermost 7.5 - 7.10을 설치하는 경우, ``client-original``\\ 에서 ``products`` "
"폴더를 ``client``\\ 로 복사합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:26
msgid "Restart your Mattermost server"
msgstr "Mattermost 서버를 다시 시작합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:28
msgid ""
"It is possible to customize certain parts of the webapp without forking "
"by using our :doc:`Custom Branding <custom-branding-tools>` settings."
msgstr ""
":doc:`사용자 지정 브랜딩 <custom-branding-tools>` 설정을 사용하면 포크하지 않고도 "
"웹앱의 특정 부분을 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:30
msgid ""
"To replace the logo in email notifications, change the file located in "
"the ``/images`` directory. To change the app icon, modify the "
"``/app/components/app_icon.js`` file."
msgstr ""
"이메일 알림의 로고를 교체하려면 ``/images`` 디렉토리에 있는 파일을 변경하세요. 앱 "
"아이콘을 변경하려면 ``/app/components/app_icon.js`` 파일을 수정하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:33
msgid "Mattermost Server"
msgstr "Mattermost 서버"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:35
msgid ""
"There are a few things you can customize in the Mattermost server without"
" forking:"
msgstr ""
"포크하지 않고도 Mattermost 서버에서 사용자 지정할 수 있는 몇 가지가 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:37
msgid "Modify text in the Mattermost interface by modifying the ``en.json`` file."
msgstr "``en.json`` 파일을 수정하여 Mattermost 인터페이스의 텍스트를 수정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:38
msgid ""
"Customize or hide help and support links by modifying your "
":ref:`configuration settings <administration-guide/configure/site-"
"configuration-settings:customization>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`구성 설정 <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-"
"settings:customization>`\\ 을 수정하여 도움말 및 지원 링크를 사용자 지정하거나 "
"숨깁니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:39
msgid ""
"Customize the email notifications by editing the HTML files in "
"``/templates``. From Mattermost v11.3.0, changes to HTML templates "
"require a server restart to take effect."
msgstr ""
"``/templates``\\ 의 HTML 파일을 편집하여 이메일 알림을 사용자 지정합니다. "
"Mattermost v11.3.0부터 HTML 템플릿 변경 사항이 적용되려면 서버 다시 시작이 "
"필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:42
msgid "Mattermost mobile apps"
msgstr "Mattermost 모바일 앱"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:44
msgid ""
"The Mattermost mobile apps can be customized if you choose to build the "
"apps yourself."
msgstr ""
"앱을 직접 빌드하기로 선택하면 Mattermost 모바일 앱을 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:46
msgid "To brand the mobile apps:"
msgstr "모바일 앱에 브랜딩을 적용하려면:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:48
msgid ""
"Fork the `mattermost-mobile <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"mobile>`_ repository."
msgstr ""
"`mattermost-mobile <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-mobile>`_ "
"저장소를 포크합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:49
msgid "Replace the name, images, and any key text strings."
msgstr "이름, 이미지, 주요 텍스트 문자열을 교체합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:50
msgid "Compile the custom apps."
msgstr "사용자 지정 앱을 컴파일합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:51
msgid "Deploy the apps to an app store."
msgstr "앱을 앱 스토어에 배포합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:53
msgid ""
"While most organizations deploy to internal enterprise app stores, you "
"are welcome to deploy to iTunes and Google Play as long as the branding "
"is not confusable with official Mattermost products."
msgstr ""
"대부분의 조직은 내부 엔터프라이즈 앱 스토어에 배포하지만, 브랜딩이 공식 Mattermost "
"제품과 혼동되지 않는 한 iTunes와 Google Play에 배포해도 좋습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:56
msgid "Mattermost desktop apps"
msgstr "Mattermost 데스크톱 앱"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:58
msgid ""
"The Mattermost desktop apps can be customized if you choose to build the "
"apps yourself."
msgstr ""
"앱을 직접 빌드하기로 선택하면 Mattermost 데스크톱 앱을 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:60
msgid "To brand the desktop apps:"
msgstr "데스크톱 앱에 브랜딩을 적용하려면:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:62
msgid ""
"Fork the `mattermost/desktop <https://github.com/mattermost/desktop>`_ "
"repository"
msgstr ""
"`mattermost/desktop <https://github.com/mattermost/desktop>`_ 저장소를 "
"포크합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:63
msgid "Replace the name, images, and any key text strings"
msgstr "이름, 이미지, 주요 텍스트 문자열을 교체합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:64
msgid ""
"Refer to `the Mattermost Developer documentation "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/more-info/desktop/>`_ for "
"help with compiling the apps"
msgstr ""
"앱 컴파일에 대한 도움말은 `Mattermost 개발자 문서 "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/more-info/desktop/>`_\\ 를 "
"참고하세요"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/customize-mattermost.rst:65
msgid "Share the desktop application with your users"
msgstr "데스크톱 애플리케이션을 사용자와 공유합니다"

